字符串是用双引号括起的字符序列（如&quot;Hello&quot;），本质是以'\\0'结尾的字符数组;</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u547644bd\" id=\"u547644bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3860eede\" id=\"u3860eede\">✅</span><span data-lake-id=\"u46f3324f\" id=\"u46f3324f\">c语言中没有字符串型变量，所以用字符数组存储；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rffqi%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"vhZlr\" id=\"vhZlr\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued5e3e63\" id=\"ued5e3e63\">3.2&gt; 字符串输出</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctchar%20arr%5B%5D%20%3D%20%7B'A'%2C%20'B'%2C%20'C'%2C%20'D'%2C%20'%5C%5C0'%7D%3B%20%5Cn%5Ctchar%20brr%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22ABCD%5C%22%3B%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cn%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22arr%20%3D%20%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20arr)%3B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22brr%20%3D%20%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20brr)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MqVpn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5b499f52\" id=\"u5b499f52\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69d3a412\" id=\"u69d3a412\">使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3c331c9a\" id=\"u3c331c9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2390535\" id=\"uf2390535\">printf( )</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7637f738\" id=\"u7637f738\">的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u26835af0\" id=\"u26835af0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u646a066b\" id=\"u646a066b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #5C8D07\">%s</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf189e5f2\" id=\"uf189e5f2\">格式符：</span><span dat